OL,3,GNEWSAToothpaste factory demolition plan
OL,4,Agets go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to demolish a former toothpaste
OL,7,Fand mouthwash factory and replace it
OL,8,Fwith three smaller industrial units has
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FThe site in Norreys Drive, Maidenhead,
OL,12,Fwas previously used by Haleon, whose
OL,13,Fbrands include Sensodyne, Centrum
OL,14,Fvitamins and Panadol painkillers.
OL,16,FIt announced in April 2024 that it
OL,17,Fwould cut 435 jobs and move out of the
OL,18,F1950s unit. It moved out for a final
OL,19,Ftime in March.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
