OL,3,GNEWSAToothpaste factory demolition plan
OL,4,Agets go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeveloper Firethorn said it hoped that
OL,7,Fabout 530 people would work at the site
OL,8,Fwhen it was brought back into use.
